    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it does define me though. it shows what i'm actually made of. i saw someone hurting and i felt nothing but fear for myself. i just stood there. i don't think i'm just \"having a hard time,\" i think i'm just a rot. i don't think i even deserve to be part of the world if this is who i am.",
